BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 642.50 Tm (features can translate text or speak it aloud.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 629.40 Tm (SAHAYAK is a prototype, which means an early version used to test an idea. It is not a complete) Tj ET
