BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 603.20 Tm (replacement for an interpreter.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 585.10 Tm (2. Why we built it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 568.10 Tm (People who use sign language may meet people who do not understand their signs. This can make) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 555.00 Tm (daily conversations harder. A tool that recognizes some trained signs may help in limited) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 541.90 Tm (situations. It should be tested with the people who may use it, and its limits must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 528.80 Tm (explained.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 515.70 Tm (The 2011 Census of India counted 5,071,007 people in its hearing-disability category. This is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 502.60 Tm (historical figure, not a count of ISL users and not a current estimate. Hearing loss and using) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 489.50 Tm (sign language are not the same thing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 476.40 Tm (Sources:) Tj ET
