BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 415.10 Tm (- A camera can help find hand key points without special gloves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 402.00 Tm (- The points can be changed into numbers.) Tj ET
