BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 362.70 Tm (- A held pose and a moving sign need separate input paths.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 349.60 Tm (- A website and a Python server can work together.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 336.50 Tm (- Testing should report mistakes as well as successful examples.) Tj ET
