BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 608.90 Tm (17. If the live demo fails) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 591.90 Tm (Say: "The live result depends on camera detection and the hosted backend. We have a prototype, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 578.80 Tm (this is a useful example of why reliability tests matter. I will explain the workflow and show) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 565.70 Tm (the parts that are available while we check the connection.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 552.60 Tm (Do not say a sign was recognized if no result appeared.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 534.50 Tm (18. Questions judges may ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 517.50 Tm (Q: What is SAHAYAK? A: A website prototype that recognizes a limited set of trained signs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 504.40 Tm (Q: Does it translate every ISL sentence? A: No. It predicts a label from a limited set.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 491.30 Tm (Q: What is a landmark? A: A key point on the hand, such as a fingertip or joint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 478.20 Tm (Q: Why 126 values? A: Two hands x 21 points x three coordinates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 465.10 Tm (Q: Why 1,320 values? A: 132 values per frame arranged into 10 time steps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 452.00 Tm (Q: Does adding a label train the model? A: No. Labelled examples, training, testing and deployment) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 438.90 Tm (are needed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 425.80 Tm (Q: Where does the camera run? A: In the browser. The backend makes the model prediction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 412.70 Tm (Q: Does it work offline? A: Not fully. Live prediction and some extra features need internet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 399.60 Tm (Q: What is the accuracy? A: Give a number only if a fair test report supports it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 386.50 Tm (Q: What if it predicts the wrong sign? A: Record the mistake and check the camera conditions and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 373.40 Tm (model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 360.30 Tm (Q: Can it replace an interpreter? A: No. It is a prototype, not a guaranteed communication) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 347.20 Tm (service.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 329.10 Tm (19. Simple word list) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 312.10 Tm (Frontend: the part of the website a user sees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 299.00 Tm (Backend: the server that handles requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 285.90 Tm (Landmark: a key point on the hand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 272.80 Tm (Feature: a number made from hand points.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 259.70 Tm (Dataset: labelled examples used for training or testing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 246.60 Tm (Model: the saved result of training.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 233.50 Tm (Prediction: the model's best guess.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 220.40 Tm (API: a web address used by the website and server to exchange information.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 207.30 Tm (Candidate model: a trial model that is not active yet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 194.20 Tm (Promote: approve a trial model and make it active.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 181.10 Tm (Deploy: publish files to the hosted website or server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 168.00 Tm (Confidence: how strongly the model favours a label; not a promise that it is right.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 145.90 Tm (20. Can GitHub train the model?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 128.90 Tm (GitHub is mainly where we save and share code. Pushing a file does not automatically teach a model) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 116.80 Tm (    a new sign. Training can run on GitHub only if a specific automated workflow, training) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 104.70 Tm (    scripts, required packages, data access and enough computer resources have been set up. Check) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 92.60 Tm (    that workflow before claiming it exists. In this project, use the known local training scripts) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 80.50 Tm (    when they are present and working. Do not upload private training recordings just to make an) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 68.40 Tm (    automatic job work.) Tj ET
