BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (21. Change website words or design without training again) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 763.00 Tm (If you only change a heading, paragraph, colour, picture or page layout, you normally do not need) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 750.90 Tm (    to train a model. Make the change in the frontend files, test the page, push the intended) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 738.80 Tm (    frontend files and wait for Vercel to finish. If you change the recognition code or feature) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 726.70 Tm (    format, test carefully because the model and frontend must still agree. A new sign needs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 714.60 Tm (    labelled data, training and evaluation; changing website text does not teach a new sign.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 692.50 Tm (22. Data storage and response time) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 675.50 Tm (A saved sample and a trained model are different things. The continuous sample database may be a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 663.40 Tm (    local file. Files on a hosted server may not remain after a service is replaced unless) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 651.30 Tm (    permanent storage is set up. Do not promise that collected samples will always be saved on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 639.20 Tm (    live server. Back up training data in a safe place and use suitable permanent storage if) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 627.10 Tm (    long-term saving is required.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 610.00 Tm (The backend can record recent API response times. Those times show how long a request took in that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 597.90 Tm (    process; they are not model accuracy and may reset when the server restarts. Measure full) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 585.80 Tm (    camera-to-screen time separately if you need that result.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 563.70 Tm (23. Confidence and movement limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 546.70 Tm (The current static prediction path uses a 0.60 confidence cutoff when a probability score is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 534.60 Tm (    available. A result below the cutoff may be treated as uncertain. This 0.60 setting does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 522.50 Tm (    mean the model is 60 percent accurate. The continuous-sign code can build a movement segment) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 510.40 Tm (    from about 15 to 90 frames before it predicts. These settings can change, so check the current) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 498.30 Tm (    code before giving exact values to judges.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 476.20 Tm (24. Evidence to keep for testing) Tj ET
